hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24285","Muhammad ibn Ja'far narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to us, from al-Hakam, from Zayd ibn Wahb, from al-Bara' ibn Azib, from Thabit ibn Wadi'ah: That he brought a lizard to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and he said: A nation was transformed, and Allah knows best."
